    "body": "Thank you for the report and the run counts.\n\nTriage: **bug**, **P3** (a flaky test that a contributor hits; workaround: run it alone or re-run), **effort:medium**, **area:ui**. It looks like the same cause as #2373: a parallel test changes process-global state while this test reads its captured output. A fix for one may close both.\n\nIf you take it on, please comment `claimed:` with your plan.\n",
